Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.92,0:00:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.94,0:00:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.32,0:00:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.84,0:00:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.60,0:00:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.70,0:00:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.52,0:00:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One piece
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.26,0:00:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'll only slow us down Your\Nheart will be your guide,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.30,0:00:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,raise the sails and take the helm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place That the end
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.58,0:01:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the map reveals Is only legendary
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.74,0:01:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until someone proves it real
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.20,0:01:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all Through all the trouble\Nand times Through the heartache
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.78,0:01:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and through the pain Know that\NI will be there to stand by you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.90,0:01:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so come aboard and bring along all your
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.36,0:01:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hopes and dreams together we will find
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.28,0:01:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everything that we're looking for there's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.04,0:01:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,always room for you if\Nyou want to be my friend
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.05,0:01:55.35,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(978,986)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2\1a&HFF&\t(936,978,\1a&H00&)\t(4314,4356,\1a&HFF&)}The Stalwart War Spear
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.05,0:01:55.35,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(978,986)\c&HFAFAFA&\bord0\4a&HFF&}The Stalwart War Spear
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.46,0:01:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.50,0:01:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You all right? Try to breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.88,0:01:55.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need a little fresh air.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.74,0:01:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want a pillow?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.98,0:01:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe some water? Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.98,0:02:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad. You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.86,0:02:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I make a great banana pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.66,0:02:06.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want some?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.57,0:02:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.49,0:02:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want him to choke to death\Non any of your culinary disasters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.74,0:02:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better that than the trots he'd get from\Nchoking down one of your raunchy meat pies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.18,0:02:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The reason I won't feed him one of my\Nmeat pies is because after one bite,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.72,0:02:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he'd think he died and gone to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.68,0:02:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.59,0:02:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't die yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.68,0:02:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this isn't good. We're in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.94,0:02:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that was just luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.60,0:02:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don Krieg is going to get up\Nand kick his ass any minute now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.02,0:02:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.44,0:02:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.18,0:02:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, boy, it's not your funeral yet, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.72,0:02:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.04,0:02:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because one of us has got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.38,0:02:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and since I'm here, I'd\Nreally like to pay my respects!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.98,0:02:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.38,0:02:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.00,0:03:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.02,0:03:06.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's taking another fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.48,0:03:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.26,0:03:12.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anyone\Nhit him because they're
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.36,0:03:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,usually dead before they get close enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.18,0:03:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fact is, he might not\Nactually be invincible
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.06,0:03:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.28,0:03:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that, the kid's pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.52,0:03:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.96,0:03:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.74,0:03:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finish him off, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.40,0:03:34.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, end it once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.48,0:03:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That punk is fighting with Don Krieg\Nas if he were the same strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.04,0:03:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be real, it's like\NI'm watching my own nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.98,0:03:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's supposed to be truly invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.00,0:03:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if he gets beaten by this little\Nkid, his reputation will be completely...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.38,0:03:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, maggots!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.72,0:03:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never doubt me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.16,0:03:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.66,0:04:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, he's gonna stop messing\Naround and step up his game!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.48,0:04:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mighty Battlespear!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.84,0:04:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.34,0:04:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An exploding spear?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.10,0:04:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.26,0:04:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gonna try to hide from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.34,0:04:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.80,0:04:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This should be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.46,0:04:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mighty battle spear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.36,0:04:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's different from the one\NI was fighting with earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.36,0:04:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When this thing hits you, you\Nwon't just be wounded and flailing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.62,0:04:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will be blown straight into hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.52,0:04:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not a normal spear!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.86,0:04:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.78,0:04:34.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not in the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.69,0:04:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not in the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.40,0:04:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That spear really sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.20,0:04:40.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It explodes every time he hits anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.20,0:04:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what's going on my knees
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.52,0:04:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's lost way too much blood he\Ncan't fight for much longer this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.20,0:04:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,better end quickly you look tired\Ntoo bad guess you should have saved a
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.22,0:05:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,little more energy damn if everything\Nrocking i can't hit him with full
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.74,0:05:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,force i've never in my life seen a\Nmore stunning weapon than the mighty
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.02,0:05:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,battle spear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.93,0:05:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don Krieg is the only one strong\Nenough to handle the spear,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.98,0:05:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since the harder he strikes with it,\Nthe bigger the explosion it causes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.36,0:05:20.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone else would just be completely\Ndestroyed by their own pathetic attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.94,0:05:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.08,0:05:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His strength is the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.54,0:05:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He causes the kind of\Ndamage no one else can,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.06,0:05:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because there's just no\None else who can swing
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.70,0:05:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a spear that easily\Nweighs more than a ton.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.38,0:05:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's exactly why Don Kaido is the\Nmost dangerous man in the East Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.72,0:05:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.96,0:05:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Char-Boy, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.18,0:05:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phew, that was really close.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.96,0:06:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just like a little bug!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.74,0:06:18.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Choreboy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.90,0:06:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.00,0:06:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not finished with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.86,0:06:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't made me so angry, I\Nwould have killed you more quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.50,0:06:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.76,0:06:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way that Chopper\Ncan take much more of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.44,0:06:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That spear is way too powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.34,0:06:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.40,0:06:52.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even with a hundred thousand more weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.02,0:06:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our chore boy can still\Nbring him to his knees?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.36,0:06:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because he does not know fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.02,0:07:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.93,0:07:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.46,0:07:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.30,0:07:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand or fall, life or death.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.88,0:07:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a struggle for your very existence,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.16,0:07:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you cannot have even the slightest\Nbit of fear or you will be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.02,0:07:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.80,0:07:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kid out there...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.28,0:08:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he's fighting...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.02,0:08:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not afraid of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.36,0:08:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even death.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.20,0:08:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it just instinct or all a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.52,0:08:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll know soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.30,0:08:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.72,0:08:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.22,0:08:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Killing himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.76,0:08:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.48,0:08:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Chowboy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.32,0:08:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it again! Kick his ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.50,0:09:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you, today is your funeral!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.60,0:09:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no doubt that Krieg\Nand his pirates are strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.46,0:09:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Chopper has something\Nthey'll never have.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.28,0:09:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Krieg may have more pirates at his\Ncommand than anyone else before him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.32,0:09:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He may have terrible weapons that cause\Nmass destruction to everything in his path.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.08,0:09:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he will never have that kid's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.76,0:09:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.67,0:09:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Battlespear!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.74,0:10:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.74,0:10:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just punched it in the head five times.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.12,0:10:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.80,0:10:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it needs a rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.28,0:10:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.50,0:10:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that your little toy's\Nbroken you're nothing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.46,0:10:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah yeah without the\Nblade it's just a bomb
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.94,0:10:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on a stick and let's face\Nit that's pretty lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.80,0:10:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.10,0:10:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.04,0:10:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine so what if it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.34,0:10:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a bomb on a stick\Nyou're in sad shape kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.90,0:10:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it'll be more than\Nenough to blow you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.14,0:10:47.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.05,0:10:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds to me like this is some sort\Nof pathetic attempt at a block.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.96,0:10:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay but you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.42,0:10:57.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your boy is pretty good, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.32,0:10:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He might be able to pull it off
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.12,0:11:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.60,0:11:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just shattered the mighty battle spear
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.76,0:11:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle he's still alive\Nafter that many explosions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.22,0:11:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way he can hold up
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.90,0:11:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.30,0:11:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your defeat is imminent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.98,0:11:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, when you defy me, you\Nsign your own death warrant!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.74,0:11:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.12,0:11:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.98,0:11:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bounce out of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.52,0:11:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice try!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.48,0:11:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many weapons does that guy have?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.42,0:12:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now come Tom!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.78,0:12:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm wearing wood-steel body armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.88,0:12:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This stuff is practically indestructible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.14,0:12:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that Tom-Tom pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.66,0:12:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DONE!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.38,0:12:51.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.44,0:12:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.80,0:13:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never defeat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.72,0:13:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This armor could take a\Nmillion more of your monkey
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.16,0:13:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,punches and it wouldn't\Nhave so much as a dent!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.92,0:13:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we'll just see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.40,0:13:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.96,0:13:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.82,0:13:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't stand a chance, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.02,0:13:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Real power comes from deadly weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.18,0:13:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're the source of true strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.68,0:13:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, only the strong are meant to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.58,0:13:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.08,0:13:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's what you think!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.92,0:13:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.14,0:13:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Foolish pride will only get you so far!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.34,0:13:52.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bazooka!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.10,0:14:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.26,0:14:08.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all that big talk,\Nthat's all you've got?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.08,0:14:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.14,0:14:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.26,0:14:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My armor's cracking!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.96,0:14:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.40,0:14:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're done for, Shura Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.86,0:14:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a trap! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.42,0:14:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.18,0:14:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoot! Shortball!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.32,0:14:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not afraid of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.74,0:14:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even death.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.32,0:15:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it just instinct, or all a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.70,0:15:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll know soon if he lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.22,0:15:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.26,0:15:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.30,0:15:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.04,0:15:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I totally win!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.92,0:15:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't over yet, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.38,0:15:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, he's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.96,0:16:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.48,0:16:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a steel net!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.10,0:16:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.40,0:16:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the ocean down there below us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.88,0:16:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like I'll be getting the\Nlast laugh after all, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.54,0:16:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take him down, dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.34,0:16:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make that little brat pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.06,0:16:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.26,0:16:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I got that jerk\Nright where I want him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.14,0:16:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He hasn't even flinched.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.74,0:16:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can he stay so cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.62,0:16:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for me to end this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.64,0:16:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.32,0:16:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Kuma! Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.32,0:17:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giant hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.68,0:17:36.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.72,0:17:38.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tang Creek was defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.52,0:17:40.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could this have happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.56,0:17:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're awesome, Chopper! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.04,0:17:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He kicked his ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.20,0:17:48.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.30,0:17:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He really won! Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.10,0:17:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta be dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.78,0:17:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Tang Creek we're talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.64,0:17:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.55,0:17:57.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who'd have thought that kid had it in him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.86,0:18:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it? What's going on? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.98,0:18:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rise and shine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.34,0:18:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Craig was beaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.52,0:18:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bet you never thought you'd see the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.54,0:18:07.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.76,0:18:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you done daydreaming\Nyet? Come on! Save that, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.32,0:18:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't swim!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.24,0:18:31.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.40,0:18:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those with the power of the\NDevil Fruit are hated by the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.88,0:18:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they lose their ability to swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.94,0:18:37.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.85,0:18:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll just sink?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.82,0:18:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could have told me that\Nsooner, you worthless old geezer!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.64,0:18:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if it's already too late?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.20,0:19:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said you wouldn't die.\NYou truly believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.42,0:19:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right well you'll have\Nto do better than that
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.32,0:19:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to beat me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.60,0:19:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I don't think it's\Ntime for me to die just yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.96,0:19:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.08,0:19:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.62,0:19:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now this fight would end\Nwas clear from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.38,0:19:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why choose death?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.72,0:19:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.34,0:19:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give up your ambition and live!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.18,0:20:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but I will not run.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.86,0:20:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I retreat a single step, I would\Nbe shattering the promises I've made.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.36,0:20:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't run.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.60,0:20:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would lose my honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.94,0:20:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, without that, there\Nwould be nothing left for me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.32,0:20:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even with a hundred thousand more weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.42,0:20:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our chore boy can still\Nbring him to his knees?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.86,0:20:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because he does not know fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.86,0:20:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Krieg may have more\Npirates at his command.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.40,0:20:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He may have terrible weapons that cause\Nmass destruction to everything in his path.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.80,0:21:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper, don't you die on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.56,0:21:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.98,0:21:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, tell us it's an act!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.00,0:21:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don Krieg has been defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.58,0:21:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.40,0:21:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the mighty ruler of the East Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.30,0:21:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well now he's down for the count.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.56,0:21:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a look at him and see for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.46,0:21:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That fancy armor of his got all busted up,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.88,0:21:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he was out as soon as he hit the deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.30,0:21:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, do you think we're lying to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.10,0:21:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and look.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.78,0:21:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was the only man I ever really admired.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.06,0:21:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How foolish. Now he's lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.94,0:21:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.94,0:21:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you move now, the poison will set in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.24,0:21:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy, don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.86,0:21:53.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chore boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.96,0:21:55.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chore boy, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.92,0:21:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.30,0:22:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still have a lot of\Nthings to do with your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.42,0:22:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.98,0:22:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.50,0:22:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are something else. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.88,0:22:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the strongest!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.92,0:22:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.64,0:22:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the greatest!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.90,0:22:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.06,0:22:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one defeats me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.70,0:22:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.61,0:22:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just stay down! Stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.30,0:22:28.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not even conscious!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.84,0:22:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, don't! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.70,0:22:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to win!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.60,0:22:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.36,0:22:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill! Enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.16,0:22:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll fight until victory is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.76,0:23:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don Krieg, we lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.48,0:23:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.46,0:23:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's leave now, while we\Nstill have a shred of dignity.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.84,0:23:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.52,0:23:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, now leave and don't ever come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.30,0:23:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji, you don't owe me any favors.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.96,0:23:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when the kid wakes up,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.20,0:23:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tell him I said I'll see\Nhim on the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.68,0:23:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.40,0:23:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where I want to go\Nwith the time I have left.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.78,0:23:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the only thing I care about.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.32,0:23:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing that keeps me going.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.02,0:23:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would seem that Donkring's obsession\Nwith the Grand Line has become mine as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.16,0:23:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.46,0:23:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that, but it's my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.40,0:24:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With this poison in my veins, I\Nmay only have a few hours to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.08,0:24:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I feel free somehow, like now I can\Nlive those last few moments on my own terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.60,0:24:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To hell with loyalty to Don Krieg.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.60,0:24:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My devotion to him was just an\Nescape from forging my own destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.72,0:24:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once your heart is set,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.22,0:24:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you pursue all your dreams with\Nevery last fiber of what you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.26,0:24:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you will never again feel\Nlost or hopeless or afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.60,0:24:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I learned all that from a brave tour boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.06,0:24:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.50,0:24:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give him the boat we use\Nto go grocery shopping!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.82,0:24:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.73,0:24:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.04,0:24:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do we have to give a perfectly\Ngood boat to a bunch of pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.58,0:24:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what's going to happen\Nto all our grocery shopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.96,0:24:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jackass! Hattie's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.98,0:24:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let them swim wherever they're going to!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.40,0:25:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go get that grocery boat now!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.50,0:25:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.26,0:25:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop shouting!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.54,0:25:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, we'll go get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.14,0:25:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna sink!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.64,0:25:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did I hesitate?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.54,0:25:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was I so worried about?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.74,0:25:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I think about it, I\Ncan't help but feel stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.98,0:26:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, we gratefully accept this boat,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.66,0:26:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and my right to assume\Nthere's no need to return it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.10,0:26:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.01,0:26:07.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't ever come back\Nhere, not for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.74,0:26:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even to return this boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.36,0:26:10.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.46,0:26:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't you ever forget, this is\Nthe restaurant where the cooks fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.24,0:26:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Baratie!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.30,0:26:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cooks there sure mean business.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.36,0:26:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a kid, I never stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.06,0:26:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Searching for a great treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.62,0:26:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a map in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.42,0:26:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That I knew would lead me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.06,0:26:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to find my way to that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.24,0:26:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before someone could beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.16,0:27:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The promised land was in my grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.32,0:27:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I wouldn't let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.00,0:27:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La la la la.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.78,0:27:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.26,0:27:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La la la la la.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.86,0:27:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't stop chasing\Nit until it comes true!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.74,0:27:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if the world ever changes,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.56,0:27:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I call out your name!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.82,0:27:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could return to the time\Nwhen everything's the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.94,0:27:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm with you,\Nmy memories won't fade!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.02,0:27:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waiting for that one true dream?

